From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 09:56:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix CSV import for real bank statements

Detect delimiter (comma/semicolon/tab), find the header row below
account-info preambles, recognise more column names (Withdrawal Amt.,
Narration, Value Dt, ...), and parse dd/mm/yy and dd-Mon-yy dates.
Broaden the file input accept list. Rebuild dist.

